{"id": "58972", "title": "强迫承欢", "author": "珺卿玥", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 3, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/58/58972.htm", "intro": "【文案】\r\n\r\n“从小到大你从来不会和我争什麽。”\r\n\r\n“只要我想要的，你都会给我是不？”\r\n\r\n“可我现在什麽都不想要啊，只想要你，完完全全的把你占有，我的哥哥你会给我的是吗？”", "base": "files/article/html/58/58972", "chapters": [{"title": "1-5", "file": "8519808.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6-9", "file": "8519810.html", "available": false}, {"title": "10完结", "file": "8519811.html", "available": false}]}